<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<workflow>
  <name>job_data_vault_load_hub_satellite</name>
  <name_sync_with_filename>Y</name_sync_with_filename>
  <description>Load a hub satellite</description>
  <extended_description>This job loads a hub satellite in a Data Vault.
Based on the parameter values the steps are:

1: Create (or replace) a lookup view for the hub satellite. This gives the generic hub satellite transformation a lookup functionality with fixed column names.
2: Create (or replace) an updateable view for the hub satellite. This gives the generic hub satellite transformation an update/insert functionality with fixed column names.
3: Create the error table (if not already present).
4: Create (or replace) the updateable view for the error table.
5: Set the connection parameters. This makes it possible to source data from different databases in 1 Data Vault run.
6: Execute the generic transformation.</extended_description>
  <workflow_version>1.11</workflow_version>
  <workflow_status>0</workflow_status>
  <created_user/>
  <created_date>2014/12/15 01:09:50.705</created_date>
